{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_02_title", "source_sha256": "6ad729679987bb84b93ee489c984512f68d1158f3933fa71466f267b6ee1543b", "ja": "本気で本気のbasketball", "zh": "全力以赴的basketball", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "20d56d05b1cc0b64503cf83f64ea9aec6aa95c5db9ba1aa9b3addbd1b0902a95", "ja": "本気でプロバスケ選手になると宣言し、\nアイドルと両方本気なら、とプロデューサー\nの許可を得た真美は、レッスン後にバスケの\n練習のために向かった先の公園で、\n一人の小生意気なバスケ娘と出会う。", "zh": "真美宣称自己要认真成为职业篮球选手，  \n制作人表示只要对偶像和篮球都认真，便同意了她的请求。  \n于是，真美在课程结束后前往公园练习篮球，  \n在那里遇见了一名有些嚣张的篮球少女。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_02_1000_null", "source_sha256": "86eaf15ee27c4038babcc8f933aca08e73ff136064974a1aa78ddde9e68ce0c6", "ja": "試合観戦翌日……", "zh": "观看比赛的第二天……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_02_1001_p", "source_sha256": "4c1392f43e7cd5b30a792eef0266af7326bfc13150001f0b7dee637f2a386a9e", "ja": "（今日はいい天気だ。こんな日は事務仕事じゃなくて\n営業に出れば良かっ……、うん？）", "zh": "（今天天气真好。这种天气，比起坐办公室处理事务，出去跑业务不是更好……嗯？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_02_1002_se", "source_sha256": "22ba061a0a6cbe42624145aaa6472d4a19590f97eb546b8bc76676eb9cc1c551", "ja": "バァン！", "zh": "砰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_02_1003_034ayu", "source_sha256": "30761eb926fc3e39a2b57f7f79d8956c8dee9d6414a0dd987881b2ccd25418ec", "ja": "{$P$}、大変だよー！　\n真美が、マジでバスケ選手になろうとしてるかも！？", "zh": "{$P$}，不得了啦——！\n真美可能真的要去当篮球选手了！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_02_1004_p", "source_sha256": "698bceb8b2cde22b3e18c7997b79111a01188443db7d58daa8772fe9dfeca06c", "ja": "え？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_02_1005_se", "source_sha256": "b4f52306c577d3ee564dd92f4b12a82758d2135185f06374b45ab7a235d888dc", "ja": "バァン！！", "zh": "砰！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_02_1006_012mam", "source_sha256": "fabfbc64383708279d5f4b224bc5f0a73e20d47e3c82d00623a204b45edede42", "ja": "話は聞いてもらった！　止めないで兄ちゃん！\n真美にはやらねばならぬことがあるのっ！", "zh": "话已经说清楚了！别拦我哥哥！\n真美有必须要做的事！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_02_1007_p", "source_sha256": "33d984b3abf5f8c88e59a24b4167199464c61f98383d1bb460edbd0ec2b69b5d", "ja": "真美……確かに昨日、そんなこと言ってたけど。\nあれ本気だったのか？", "zh": "真美……你昨天确实说过那种话。\n你是认真的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_02_1008_012mam", "source_sha256": "b45f5ebb9f0df5e598b703ab345f51394fcd5f5eea098f1ef8e9d1d7e90f2d47", "ja": "モチのロンだよ！\n今まで真美が本気じゃなかったことあった！？", "zh": "当然是真的呀！\n真美什么时候说过不是认真的话！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_02_1009_p", "source_sha256": "fcb9cfcfc1ddb45b74ec7f7786be816e2c1a5cbc878b8ae3ca77b2138c6eb3bc", "ja": "そうだな、結構あった。", "zh": "是啊，确实有不少次。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_02_1010_012mam", "source_sha256": "16adf2be3a8312c0494e1ee7011e40c346653a4cbcb4657154939d8de0dd6067", "ja": "それはそう。でも今回は本気だかんね！\n本気と書いてホンキと読むんだかんね！", "zh": "确实如此。不过这次我是认真的，知道吗！  \n“认真”写作“本気”，读作“ホンキ”，知道吗！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_02_1011_p", "source_sha256": "36b96e6c51ac194a7cde82b61b74088d71c223441273666480045ad98174fcda", "ja": "（この表情……少なくとも、\nバスケをやりたいのは本当みたいだな）", "zh": "（至少想打篮球是真的啊。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_02_1012_006mak", "source_sha256": "c486a766c9839f3a672d77a3ed29ae6df5c3b9accf22f025b2e021d66e85459d", "ja": "いたいた。真美、ホントに着替えちゃったんだ？\nまだレッスン終わってないのに。", "zh": "找到了。真美，你真的换好衣服了啊？\n明明课程还没结束呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_02_1013_018ele", "source_sha256": "df32b1ed52b91751400a73d233348bc2bb1eada3cb0fc3d4ec6d1f6a26187bcf", "ja": "戻って一緒にフリを覚えようヨ～。\nダンスの先生も待ってるヨ？", "zh": "回来一起学舞步吧～。\n舞蹈老师也在等着呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_02_1014_012mam", "source_sha256": "d2d70d77c85b7ee4c4020c5475c0db72710b4da9fe066db6add200a645b4ad45", "ja": "まこちんもえれなんも止めないで！　真美は今日、\n行くしかないんだよ。運命感じちゃったの！", "zh": "真哥和艾莲娜都别拦着我！真美今天\n必须得去。我已经感受到命运的召唤了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_02_1015_p", "source_sha256": "012e46cc5de4a4f1cfd9930e636cd3a96199472afa153a79cac2a779388780cc", "ja": "というと？", "zh": "这话怎么说？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_02_1016_012mam", "source_sha256": "af8755dc6c38b241a35d9d443135cc18c5ff6d1e0af9c31722549b64ef2ae7ef", "ja": "じつはね、今日劇場に来る途中で、\nバスケのゴールがあるイイ感じの公園見つけたんだ～♪", "zh": "其实呢，我今天来剧场的路上，发现了一个有篮球架、感觉很棒的公园～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_02_1017_012mam", "source_sha256": "4019fffc76b69b401d5f89cc4c05b5f71c1665108a2e123797fa9010e14da2d5", "ja": "ほら、釘はアツいうちに打てっていうっしょ？\n真美のバスケ熱も、アツいうちに打たないと！", "zh": "你看，不是都说要趁热打铁吗？\n真美对篮球的热情，也得趁热打铁才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_02_1018_p", "source_sha256": "9e8387fbf29a731bdd37406b657c1a0fd842b28e28a034d9dafddfd67b1ff2f2", "ja": "まぁ、バスケをすること自体はいいんだけど。\nあと釘じゃなくて鉄だけど、アイドルはどうするんだ？", "zh": "好吧，打篮球本身倒是没什么问题。\n还有那不是打钉子是趁热打铁……那偶像工作你打算怎么办？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_02_1019_012mam", "source_sha256": "4445cbfa626cd3b9641a080da23d67d5b5903027ca105305be633b98cde73233", "ja": "やるに決まってるっしょ？　バスケとアイドル、\nどっちもやるの。ニソクのワラビするの！！", "zh": "当然要做啊？篮球和偶像，两个都要做。我要当身兼两职的蕨菜！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_02_1020_012mam", "source_sha256": "b4000cf0a21be5b93a6d33c1ccd9c7cd3b263f37ea55911a45f1fef0d141ef5d", "ja": "亜美も竜宮小町で兄ちゃんと律っちゃんのニソワラして\nるんだし。真美はアイドルとバスケでニソワラする！", "zh": "亚美也在龙宫小町和哥哥、律子姐一起搞“两鞋”嘛。真美要在偶像和篮球之间搞“两鞋”！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_02_1021_p", "source_sha256": "885b86d408bb83826efdddf084d51f32f843c3d27f585237e8e6f6f3f85d19c7", "ja": "……なるほど。ワラビだとだいぶ美味しそうだけど、\nつまり両方とも、ちゃんと本気なんだな？", "zh": "……原来如此。蕨菜听起来确实很好吃，不过，也就是说，你们两个都是真心认真对待的吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_02_1022_012mam", "source_sha256": "fe720de3e05cae8bd4ddfa77b2355931909f6e8260f7820a364c4fb51b632bce", "ja": "うん。……うんうん！", "zh": "嗯。……嗯嗯！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_02_1023_p", "source_sha256": "cd1b9a1a3b67ef5aa6f70a57416a8f94d9faace6ebabaee726b2ea84a881d6cd", "ja": "わかった。じゃあ俺から言うことは何もないよ。\n思う存分やってみるといい。", "zh": "明白了。那我就没什么要说的了。\n你就尽情去试试吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_02_1024_012mam", "source_sha256": "e865bd6377b41e266980081e3a8c335f0cd617e4f75b6149aaf0b7fc9aa4f27f", "ja": "兄ちゃん……！！（ええっ！？）", "zh": "哥哥……！！（诶诶！？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_02_1025_034ayu", "source_sha256": "3e30faa80de01e9852eb3ab74c01218d43a418628c8b693aac39ccead8429b15", "ja": "ええっ！？", "zh": "咦咦！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_02_1026_018ele", "source_sha256": "3e30faa80de01e9852eb3ab74c01218d43a418628c8b693aac39ccead8429b15", "ja": "ええっ！？", "zh": "咦咦！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_02_1027_006mak", "source_sha256": "3e30faa80de01e9852eb3ab74c01218d43a418628c8b693aac39ccead8429b15", "ja": "ええっ！？", "zh": "咦咦！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_02_1028_p", "source_sha256": "c172335214bd6fdc8055975b3550fd46f876c6dc38498c8e4c72d89e8da71bd4", "ja": "でもレッスンをサボるようじゃ、アイドルに本気とは\n言えない。レッスンの後でバスケに行くのはどうだ？", "zh": "不过，要是连训练都想偷懒，就不能说是真心想当偶像。训练结束后再去打篮球，怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_02_1029_012mam", "source_sha256": "73155f381c4aa7ead53f2709742d1a5366d2fd93495b03351a164a8e05b35d3b", "ja": "あ、そっか。さっすが兄ちゃん、あんたスルドイぜ！\nんじゃ、もっかい着替えてレッスンしてくんね～♪", "zh": "啊，原来如此。真不愧是哥哥，你可真敏锐啊！\n那我再换一次衣服去练习啦～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_02_1030_se", "source_sha256": "0c6947667069d1dd33c1aa62219913a56731eebbc4b20f0fbae5f7c2da6630c3", "ja": "ガチャ……バタン！", "zh": "咔哒……砰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_02_1031_034ayu", "source_sha256": "4c6b6dd9565807088d2127eb32514e454aef8f3a4d72f036be534296247de7ef", "ja": "ちょっと{$P$}、両方って……\n本当にあんなこと言っちゃってよかったの？", "zh": "等等，{$P$}，两个都……说出那种话真的没关系吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_02_1032_p", "source_sha256": "0dbd9d8ee80344d3b1528f1d505031ace35ea835463a3a82cf49ddcd6809db78", "ja": "まぁ、せっかくのやる気に水を差すのも\n違うかなと思って。", "zh": "不过，我想着要是泼了她难得的干劲，\n感觉也不太好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_02_1033_006mak", "source_sha256": "4f23d3a2daff500ae662f754a65ba859f5902f8f4c36cad0823f53a2fbedddc2", "ja": "うーん。今は亜美が竜宮小町のツアー中だし、\n真美の気持ちもわかりますけど……。", "zh": "嗯……现在亚美正在参加龙宫小町的巡演，我也能理解真美的心情，但是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_02_1034_018ele", "source_sha256": "bf33c95714b20741a39668d78621c071a7284564be0c26ea5eb68d248fc8b4f0", "ja": "いつも一緒の双子だもんネ。\nちょっとスネちゃってるのかナ？", "zh": "毕竟是总在一起的双胞胎嘛。\n是不是有点闹别扭了呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_02_1035_p", "source_sha256": "37879ada0f8b9e9688181a597b808f667726ca9e939b955e5bf569c3bbd712d9", "ja": "そういう部分もあるかもしれないな。\nでも、今はバスケに夢中なのも本当だと思うよ。", "zh": "或许也有这方面的原因吧。\n不过，我觉得她现在确实也很着迷于篮球。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_02_1036_p", "source_sha256": "a711343fa3dcb974aef17e7ee8aca81d3c49a7f2555c10979f50a0005c416575", "ja": "バスケの勉強なら今度の仕事のためになるし。\nやり過ぎない限り、悪い方向にいくことはないと思う。", "zh": "学习篮球也能为下次的工作派上用场。\n只要不过度，我觉得不会往坏的方向发展。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_02_1037_034ayu", "source_sha256": "d72522b5c48d2ad95313b127d9ffe1cbf2a661ec8effc8737989dfbb191c9864", "ja": "あ～、そっか。バスケ自体もうまい方が絶対、\nいいに決まってるもんね。", "zh": "啊～，也是呢。篮球本身肯定也是\n打得越好越好嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_02_1038_018ele", "source_sha256": "b83da96f48ba1b720b61745f932b2b59436ee26436188375d10f4da429ccece2", "ja": "ウン、そうだネ！　ワタシ達も大好きになってるけど\nもーっと好きになれるなら、その方がいいもんネ♪", "zh": "嗯，就是嘛！我们也已经很喜欢了，不过要是能变得更喜欢，那不是更好吗♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_02_1039_p", "source_sha256": "3cdd88c7ada7fa94fdac8d3e3c7099f9d200d21bb9951d5d7f794d59810f5336", "ja": "だから、やり過ぎないよう見守るくらいでいいと思う。\n無茶はしないよう、みんなも少し気にしてやってくれ。", "zh": "所以，我觉得只要看着她，别让她做得太过头就够了。也请大家稍微留意一下，别让她做出什么乱来的事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_02_1040_006mak", "source_sha256": "268439331b6d23d4e901464b912329202f8653f810b59860d11ac606b48c4fbe", "ja": "わかりました。じゃあボクらも真美と一緒に、バスケの\n上達を目指すつもりで。今はレッスンに戻りますね！", "zh": "明白了。那么我们也打算和真美一起努力提高篮球水平。现在先回去上课了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_02_1041_null", "source_sha256": "ea4ffeaacfbe0531fd7dc1abdbcf5a638edeee07bb268e56acec0d5eaf8e1e48", "ja": "そして、レッスン終了後……", "zh": "然后，在课程结束后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_02_1042_se", "source_sha256": "8512166c548f6dc2a46c4858b856b08c3ecb7c11ba1346ef1987cc19d4a066e7", "ja": "ダムダム、ダンッ……ティン……ティン……", "zh": "咚咚、砰……叮……叮……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_02_1043_ao", "source_sha256": "6595b7e3ca07c1644096a5095bc09fd5e329cd0a0a5a3f411fc5b23435c30828", "ja": "あーあ、全然ゴール入んないし。\nやっぱ、調子わる……。", "zh": "唉，一个球都没进。\n果然状态不好……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_02_1044_012mam", "source_sha256": "4d18ac03a1234028f5abeefc845156ec41b52709a6e1a3af852028088df30797", "ja": "到着っと！　あ、誰かもう使ってる？　でも一人だし、\n真美と同い年ぐらいの子だ。チャーンス！", "zh": "到了！啊，已经有人在用了？不过只有一个人，而且还是个和真美差不多大的孩子。机——会！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_02_1045_012mam", "source_sha256": "466b7d690dcd03ad645b3af03a9cfb6198f0c52a3995309a550a476f00ea73ab", "ja": "ヘイ、そこのバスケ娘！\nよかったら真美とイイコトしな～い？", "zh": "嘿，那边打篮球的姑娘！\n要不要和真美一起做点开心的事～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_02_1046_ao", "source_sha256": "151139c34948d1a7333bcd7093f9da619a72e5380b3c36bb56a7abc888ad8342", "ja": "うわ、何。へんな奴？", "zh": "哇，什么啊。奇怪的家伙？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_02_1047_012mam", "source_sha256": "e28873d947989ebbd76e15ebf8afb752d7d9a4ae35ce2e6d7d6363d0af743d83", "ja": "いいえ、真美は通りすがりのバスケ好きな美少女。\n怪しいものじゃないよ～ん。んっふっふ～♪", "zh": "才不是呢，真美只是个路过的喜欢篮球的美少女。\n可不是什么可疑分子哦～嗯哼哼～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_02_1048_ao", "source_sha256": "cb337c3addac67d660f29d78696ba21872f0bc16b236953f327dc2e02fbfaf86", "ja": "ものっすごい怪しいじゃん。あと、ウチは一人で\nシュート練習したいだけだから。邪魔すんなし。", "zh": "太可疑了吧。而且，我只是想一个人\n练习投篮而已。别来碍事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_02_1049_012mam", "source_sha256": "5ed8b92f66ce37fa8ed6a2fdc1ae6faaf33d18cdc30961b5e87fe695836931f4", "ja": "えーなんで？　いーじゃんいーじゃん、\nバスケは一人でやるもんじゃないっしょ？", "zh": "诶——为什么？不也挺好嘛挺好嘛，篮球本来就不是一个人打的吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_02_1050_012mam", "source_sha256": "a2d2cc0a60c878f127e8f0383c7bf72904088f4bdd9347521c425295f1f3d3b3", "ja": "いいかね、バスケ娘君。バスケは今プロリーグが\nめっちゃ盛り上がってて、めっちゃアツいわけ！", "zh": "听好了，篮球姑娘。职业篮球联赛现在可是火得不得了，正热闹着呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_02_1051_ao", "source_sha256": "0d621019b2fbd31df9bf7862d792fd65778733dd6f642dddf6b638a08e8b2e33", "ja": "……知ってるし。今さら何いってんの。", "zh": "……我知道啦。现在还说这个干嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_02_1052_012mam", "source_sha256": "dd685b964f622bec6f66568bd6f23b08e85215d18a44af67e4b22a78ae448cce", "ja": "むぅ、小生意気なバスケ娘め。でも今度そこで真美が\n何する予定かは知らないっしょ？　知らないっしょ～！", "zh": "呜，好狂妄的篮球丫头。不过真美下次\n打算在那里做什么，你还不知道吧？不知道吧～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_02_1053_ao", "source_sha256": "e74a654ab32a8ff3d1fa0aee40408a7291a11641114310f1b4c8b9b3ac16f7b1", "ja": "むか。なに、リーグの関係者の家の子とか？\n……別に、どーでもいいし。", "zh": "真火大。什么啊，是联赛相关人士家里的小孩吗？\n……无所谓，反正跟我又没关系。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_02_1054_012mam", "source_sha256": "57251459523bc7d56766a6d3620af8b88def270abb2a32d5d85261b166e58f03", "ja": "仕方ないなぁ。とにかく生でプロの試合を観たばっかの\n真美が、バスケの楽しさを教えてあげるから。カモン♪", "zh": "真拿你没办法。总之，刚现场看完职业比赛的真美，会教你篮球的乐趣。来吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_02_1055_ao", "source_sha256": "ff7df7859c618bab6666aa2d28cbbb7a3c642eb3b1a179fb35e494a1dbbc3e87", "ja": "……はん。ミーハーなだけじゃん。ださ。", "zh": "……哼。不就是跟风嘛。真土。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_02_1056_012mam", "source_sha256": "a21aa28dee9f6ab44476a5abbe4c72a23f6324a4a37b6289af47711e7993e621", "ja": "むっか～、言ってくれるじゃん！　もう怒った！\nこうなったら、真美とバスケ勝負だー！", "zh": "气死人啦～，真敢说啊！真美真的生气了！\n既然这样，那就来跟真美比一场篮球吧——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_02_1057_ao", "source_sha256": "45ca8d5439b3a6aeb852277d35f2033ae89f8d0778b20f72fdc729ff6361609c", "ja": "はぁ？　なんでそうなるわけ？\n意味わかんないし！", "zh": "哈？为什么会变成这样啊？\n完全搞不懂！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_02_1058_012mam", "source_sha256": "4a488be166ee356927a6ac5aa2c0e10009f79079184abbdd1ce24d27f3f82a25", "ja": "おっ、さては真美に負けるのが怖いんだね？\nんっふっふ～♪　かっこわる～♪", "zh": "哦，原来你是害怕输给真美吧？\n嗯哼哼～♪ 真逊～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_02_1059_ao", "source_sha256": "bb16267ac9708c9d5cccb15ae91976c431ecaf026db16581904b98102421d434", "ja": "違うし！　……わかったよ。やってやんよ！\nいっとくけど、手加減しないから。", "zh": "才不是！……知道了。就让你见识一下！\n先说好，我可不会手下留情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_02_1060_012mam", "source_sha256": "28d386bb0e10019fe91d878a2d5dbb6aed476af9530c2f61cacdd1b6b5ef5638", "ja": "オッケーオッケー、真美も加減を知らない美少女だから\n大丈夫！　でさ、試合ってどやって始めんの？", "zh": "好啦好啦，真美也是个不懂手下留情的美少女嘛，没问题！话说，比赛要怎么开始啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_02_1061_ao", "source_sha256": "f655188f96a3e91eefd084342817298d620a4ead01e9bfbd9140d798e31815b0", "ja": "……は？\n……アンタ、バスケ歴何年？", "zh": "……哈？\n……你，打篮球多少年了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_02_1062_012mam", "source_sha256": "bd9ce8d78dfabe5d63bf428f5887b46f22988054b7d49d364259820f86b35c60", "ja": "今日が初めてだけど？　あと体育。", "zh": "虽然是今天第一次打篮球，不过体育课除外。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_02_1063_ao", "source_sha256": "70eb09257a62c5f17ba92897f207b0adc657a12b51945f4afd7959a16438aba6", "ja": "はぁ！？！？！？！？", "zh": "哈！？！？！？！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
